    "description": "API reference for EmergencyCall in @erlcjs/core.",
    "section": "api",
    "order": 10,
    "content": "Represents an active emergency call in the ER:LC server.\r\n\r\n**Signature:**\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\ndeclare class EmergencyCall extends Base \r\n```\r\n**Extends:** [Base](/docs/api/core/base/)\r\n\r\n## Constructors\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nConstructor\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[(constructor)(server, data)](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nCreates an instance of EmergencyCall.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Properties\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nProperty\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nType\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[caller?](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Player](/docs/api/core/player/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ The Player instance representing the caller, if they are still cached.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[callerId](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe UserId of the player who made the emergency call.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[callNumber](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe unique call number.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[description](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe description text of the emergency call.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[playerIds](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nArray of UserIds of responders assigned to this call.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[players](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Player](/docs/api/core/player/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nArray of Player instances of active responders assigned to this call.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[position](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe game position coordinates \\[x, y\\] of the call.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[positionDescriptor](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nPositional description of where the call was made.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[startedAt](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nUnix timestamp of when the call was started.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[team](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe team associated with the emergency call (e.g., \"Police\", \"Fire\").\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Methods\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nMethod\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[\\_patch(data)](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nPatches the EmergencyCall structure with new raw data.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[toJSON()](/docs/api/core/emergencycall/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nConverts this EmergencyCall instance to raw JSON representation.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>"
