    "content": "Manager responsible for fetching, caching, and updating JoinLog structures.\r\n\r\n**Signature:**\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\ndeclare class JoinLogManager \r\n```\r\n\r\n## Constructors\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nConstructor\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[(constructor)(server, maxCacheSize)](/docs/api/core/joinlogmanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nCreates an instance of JoinLogManager.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Properties\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nProperty\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nType\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[cache](/docs/api/core/joinlogmanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Collection](/docs/api/core/collection/)&lt;string, [JoinLog](/docs/api/core/joinlog/)&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nCollection cache of join and leave logs, keyed by a composite `Player:Timestamp:Join` key.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Methods\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nMethod\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[fetchAll()](/docs/api/core/joinlogmanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nFetches all join logs from the game server. Updates the join log cache.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[updateCache(rawJoinLogs)](/docs/api/core/joinlogmanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nRe-synchronizes the cache with the raw join logs. Emits a joinLog event for new logs.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>"
