    "section": "api",
    "order": 10,
    "content": "Represents a log of a player death event (kill).\r\n\r\n**Signature:**\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\ndeclare class KillLog extends Base \r\n```\r\n**Extends:** [Base](/docs/api/core/base/)\r\n\r\n## Constructors\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nConstructor\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[(constructor)(server, data)](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nCreates an instance of KillLog.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Properties\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nProperty\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nType\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[killed?](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Player](/docs/api/core/player/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ The Player instance representing the player who was killed, if they are still cached.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[killedId](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe UserId of the player who was killed.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[killedUsername](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe Roblox username of the player who was killed.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[killer?](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Player](/docs/api/core/player/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ The Player instance representing the player who did the killing, if they are still cached.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[killerId](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe UserId of the player who did the killing.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[killerUsername](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe Roblox username of the player who did the killing.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[timestamp](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nUnix timestamp of when the kill occurred.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Methods\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nMethod\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[\\_patch(data)](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nPatches the KillLog structure with new raw data.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[toJSON()](/docs/api/core/killlog/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nConverts this KillLog instance to raw JSON representation.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>"
