    "content": "Manager responsible for fetching, caching, and updating Player structures.\r\n\r\n**Signature:**\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\ndeclare class PlayerManager \r\n```\r\n\r\n## Constructors\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nConstructor\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[(constructor)(server)](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nCreates an instance of PlayerManager.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Properties\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nProperty\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nType\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[cache](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Collection](/docs/api/core/collection/)&lt;number, [Player](/docs/api/core/player/)&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nCollection cache of online Players, keyed by their UserId.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[onlineStaff](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n`readonly`\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Player](/docs/api/core/player/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nGets a list of all players with a permission level other than 'Normal'.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[wanted](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n`readonly`\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[Player](/docs/api/core/player/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nGets a list of all players with a wanted level greater than 0.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>\r\n\r\n## Methods\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nMethod\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[clear()](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nClears the player cache and username mappings.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[fetchAll()](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nFetches all active players currently in the game server. Updates the player cache.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[getIdFromName(name)](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nRetrieves a player's UserId from their Roblox username, resolving from cache.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[unadmin(userId)](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nUnadmins a player from their userId.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[unban(userId)](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nUnbans a player from their userId.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[unhelper(userId)](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nUnhelpers a player from their userId.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[unmod(userId)](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nUnmods a player from their userId.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[updateCache(rawPlayers)](/docs/api/core/playermanager/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nRe-synchronizes the cache with the raw player list from the API. Emits playerJoin, playerLeave, and playerUpdate events.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>"
