    "section": "api",
    "order": 10,
    "content": "Error thrown when the resource being accessed is restricted.\r\n\r\n**Signature:**\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\ndeclare class RestrictedResourceError extends Error \r\n```\r\n**Extends:** Error\r\n\r\n## Constructors\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nConstructor\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[(constructor)(message)](/docs/api/core/restrictedresourceerror/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nConstructs a new instance of the `RestrictedResourceError` class\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>"
