    "order": 20,
    "content": "Raw data structure representing the full server information payload from ER:LC.\r\n\r\n**Signature:**\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\ninterface RawServerData \r\n```\r\n\r\n## Properties\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nProperty\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nType\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[AccVerifiedReq](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n'Disabled' \\| 'Email' \\| 'Phone/ID'\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nVerification level requirement for joining.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[CommandLogs?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawCommandLog](/docs/api/core/rawcommandlog/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ Server command logs.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[CoOwnerIds](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nList of UserIds of server co-owners.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[CurrentPlayers](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nNumber of players currently in the server.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[EmergencyCalls?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawEmergencyCall](/docs/api/core/rawemergencycall/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ Active emergency calls.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[JoinKey](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe join key of the server.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[JoinLogs?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawJoinLog](/docs/api/core/rawjoinlog/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ Server join/leave logs.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[KillLogs?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawKillLog](/docs/api/core/rawkilllog/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ Server kill logs.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[MaxPlayers](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nMaximum allowed players in the server.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[ModCalls?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawModCall](/docs/api/core/rawmodcall/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ Active moderator calls.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Name](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe server name.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[OwnerId](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe UserId of the server owner.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Players?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawPlayerData](/docs/api/core/rawplayerdata/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ List of active players.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Queue?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nnumber\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ UserIds currently in the join queue.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Staff?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawStaffData](/docs/api/core/rawstaffdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ Server staff lists.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[TeamBalance](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nboolean\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nWhether team balance is enabled.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Vehicles?](/docs/api/core/rawserverdata/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n[RawVehicle](/docs/api/core/rawvehicle/)\\[\\]\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ Active vehicles spawned.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>"
