    "content": "Raw data structure representing a vehicle.\r\n\r\n**Signature:**\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\ninterface RawVehicle \r\n```\r\n\r\n## Properties\r\n\r\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable API table\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>\r\n\r\nProperty\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nModifiers\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nType\r\n\r\n\r\n</th><th>\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\n\r\n</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n[ColorHex](/docs/api/core/rawvehicle/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nHexadecimal color code of the vehicle.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[ColorName](/docs/api/core/rawvehicle/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe color name of the vehicle.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Name](/docs/api/core/rawvehicle/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe name/model of the vehicle.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Owner](/docs/api/core/rawvehicle/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe username of the vehicle owner.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Plate](/docs/api/core/rawvehicle/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nThe license plate of the vehicle.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n[Texture?](/docs/api/core/rawvehicle/)\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\nstring \\| null\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td>\r\n\r\n_(Optional)_ The custom texture path or name of the vehicle.\r\n\r\n\r\n</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div>"
